- The failing Pod s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 (ReplicaSet s1-app-5468546b65) and the healthy Pod s1-app-666f75b99-nlpbt (ReplicaSet s1-app-666f75b99) both run container app with the identical image docker.io/library/bianque-s1-app:dev. [ev_6fbf4102f4, ev_141ec6beec]
